### API Pokemon - Tests
### Utilisez l'extension REST Client dans VS Code pour tester ces endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. GET - Récupérer tous les pokemons (page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons?page=1

### 2. GET - Récupérer page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons?page=2

### 3. GET - Rechercher Pikachu
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/search?name=pikachu

### 4. GET - Rechercher Bulbasaur
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/search?name=bulbasaur

### 5. GET - Pokemon par ID (Bulbasaur)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/1

### 6. GET - Pokemon par ID (Pikachu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/25

### 7. POST - Créer un nouveau pokemon
POST {{baseUrl}}/pokemons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": {
    "english": "Testmon",
    "japanese": "テストモン",
    "chinese": "测试兽",
    "french": "Testmon"
  },
  "type": ["Normal", "Flying"],
  "base": {
    "HP": 100,
    "Attack": 120,
    "Defense": 80,
    "SpecialAttack": 110,
    "SpecialDefense": 90,
    "Speed": 95
  },
  "image": "http://localhost:3000/assets/pokemons/999.png"
}

### 8. PUT - Modifier complètement un pokemon (ID 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": {
    "english": "Super Bulbasaur",
    "japanese": "スーパーフシギダネ",
    "chinese": "超级妙蛙种子",
    "french": "Super Bulbizarre"
  },
  "type": ["Grass", "Poison", "Dragon"],
  "base": {
    "HP": 150,
    "Attack": 100,
    "Defense": 100,
    "SpecialAttack": 150,
    "SpecialDefense": 150,
    "Speed": 100
  },
  "image": "http://localhost:3000/assets/pokemons/1.png"
}

### 9. PATCH - Modifier partiellement un pokemon (juste HP)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "base": {
    "HP": 200
  }
}

### 10. DELETE - Supprimer un pokemon (ID 999)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/999

### 11. GET - Vérifier la racine de l'API
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 12. GET - Test 404 (Pokemon inexistant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/99999

### 13. GET - Test recherche sans résultat
GET {{baseUrl}}/pokemons/search?name=nonexistant
